= Christian Left faction leaves <span style="color: #000000;">**Center Party**</span>!

Joseph Wirth, outraged by Stegerwald's right-wing turn and concerned for the future of the Republic, has swayed much of the <span style="color: #FF6B21;">**catholic left**</span> to form a new party. They have expressed willingness to join a broad republican party, besides the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span>, but only under a labor-friendly leadership.
